{title: Kitna Haseen Chehra}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Nadeem Shravan}
{key: G#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#m],        Kitna haseen chehra
[G#m],        Kitni pyari aankhen
[C#m],        Kitni pyari aankhen hai
[B],        Aankhon se chhalakta pyar
[E] [B],        Kudrat ne banaya hoga
[B] [G#m],        Phursat se tujhe mere yaar
[C#m] [G#m],        Teri nazar jhuke toh shaam dhalen
[C#m] [G#m],        Jo uthe nazar toh subaha chalen
[G#m] [E],        Tu hase toh kaliyan khil jaaye
[G#m] [E],        Tujhe dekh ke hoor bhi sharmaye
[G#m],        Teri bikhri bikhri zulfen
[G#m],        Teri mehaki mehaki saansen
[G#m],        Teri koyal jaisi boli
[G#m],        Teri meethi meethi baaten
[C#m],        Jee chahe mera main
[B],        Yu hi tera karta rahu deedar
[E] [B],        Kudrat ne banaya hoga
[B] [G#m],        Phursat se tujhe mere yaar
[C#m] [G#m],        Duniya mein haseen aur bhi hain
[C#m] [G#m],        Hoga na koi tere jaisa haseen
[G#m] [E],        Rangeen jawan madhosh badan
[G#m] [E],        Tu husno shabab ka hain gulshan
[G#m],        Tere ang se khusbu barse
[G#m],        Pariyon si sundar kaya
[G#m],        Jo kutch socha tha maine
[G#m],        Woh sab kutch tujhmein paya
[C#m],        Teri ek adaa pe
[B],        Main sadke jaaun sau baar
[E] [B],        Kudrat ne banaya hoga
[B] [G#m],        Phursat se tujhe mere yaar
